"""
photon_analysis_v3.py
=====================
Reco photon analysis: Geant4 (3 parts merged) vs CaloClouds.
Reads reco files only. MC truth angles are handled separately
by mc_angle_analysis.py.

Plots produced (all raw counts, saved to ~/thesis-ml-sim/plots/photon-analysis/):
  1. Energy spectrum  — G4 vs CC total vs CC ML component (log y)
  2. Energy breakdown — G4 vs CC-G4-type vs CC-ML (log y)
  3. Reco theta       — G4 vs CC total
  4. Reco theta       — CC breakdown: G4-type vs ML vs full G4
  5. Reco phi         — G4 vs CC total
  6. Reco phi         — CC breakdown: G4-type vs ML vs full G4

Run with:
    source ~/source.sh
    python3 photon_analysis_v3.py
"""

